fw:Area_AP2_Archive a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Archive checks: what an archived lineage leaves behind and how it is judged"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-10-29: the archived-digest check lists 12 archived lineages as not reproducing, one of them (Lineage 20) only because the check reads the archive alone while the live gate reads the register's digest table; the archive tool left 59 statements of Lineage 20 in the live register because they were written in full-IRI form." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/, 04-documentation/" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Area_AP2_Step a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Execution: the faults made by hand when a box is recorded"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-10-29: four classes of by-hand fault were found in boxes 4 to 9 of Lineage 20 and the first box of Lineage 21 was never closed (records composed in one pass, a record edited in place, work done before its box was opened, a name changed by hand); no tool refuses any of them. The step tool now has three commands that record a box (open, act, close) and refuses those four faults, but it carries the obligations of a status as code, not as read from the register." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/, 04-documentation/" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Area_AP2_Profile a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Profile: the opt-in rule sets that no profile decides"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-10-29: 8 rule sets are in no profile; 2 are adopted by the register, 6 by nothing; the adaptive profile has a recorded decision on 0 of the 8." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/, 04-documentation/" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Area_AP2_Gate a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Cost: what a release gate spends on records"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-10-29: a records-only release spent about 647 s in the gate and about 292 s in the publisher in Lineage 21; 11 probes still re-run on a records-only change." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/, 04-documentation/" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Area_AP2_Proof a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Proof and learning: the profile judged on live work, and what the first run taught"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-10-29: 0 boxes have been closed under the adaptive profile; Lineage 21 was closed as failed with a post-mortem of 14 findings, and this lineage is the first to open under profile revision 8." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/, 04-documentation/" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Del_AP2_D1 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "An archived lineage's recorded stage digests are checked against the same digest table the live gate uses, so a lineage that reproduces live is not listed as failing in the archive"@en ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea fw:Area_AP2_Archive ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "carried on real work from an immature mission" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Del_AP2_D2 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "The archive tool moves every statement of an archived lineage whatever its IRI form, and leaves none in the live register"@en ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea fw:Area_AP2_Archive ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "carried on real work from an immature mission" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Del_AP2_D3 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "The step tool reads the obligations of a lineage status from the register, prints them when a box is opened, and refuses to close a box that leaves one unmet"@en ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea fw:Area_AP2_Step ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "the faults that were made by hand are removed by a lineage-step tool" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Del_AP2_D4 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Each box of this lineage is recorded with the step tool and judged by the ceremony rule sets this lineage adopted, with no violation at its close"@en ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea fw:Area_AP2_Proof ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "its ceremonies are recorded and judged by the rules it adopted" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Del_AP2_D5 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Each of the eight opt-in rule sets has a recorded decision for the adaptive profile (included, or left opt-in with its reason), and the revision that includes the chosen ones is shown refusing a planted fault on a test register"@en ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea fw:Area_AP2_Profile ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "its ceremonies are recorded and judged by the rules it adopted" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Del_AP2_D6 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "The release gate for a release that only adds records re-runs no probe whose inputs did not change, and its time for each release of this lineage is recorded from the gate's own timing record"@en ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea fw:Area_AP2_Gate ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "matured step by step in time-boxed iterations" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Del_AP2_D7 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "A post-mortem of this first application of the adaptive profile is written before the closure, naming the steps missed and the faults found after completion, each as a finding"@en ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea fw:Area_AP2_Proof ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "carried on real work from an immature mission" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Ex_AP2_Default a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Exclusion: The adaptive profile becomes the default"@en ;
    backlog:excludesConcern "The adaptive profile becomes the default." ;
    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "The Owner decides this after a live proof and an effort comparison; this lineage supplies the proof and does not decide." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Ex_AP2_Others a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Exclusion: The standard and the agentic profile"@en ;
    backlog:excludesConcern "The standard and the agentic profile." ;
    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "They stay as they are; the adaptive profile is built beside them." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Ex_AP2_Validator a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Exclusion: The validator's internal speed"@en ;
    backlog:excludesConcern "The validator's internal speed." ;
    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "The cost is cut by keying probes on what they read; the validator is not changed here." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Ex_AP2_Closed a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Exclusion: Records of closed lineages"@en ;
    backlog:excludesConcern "Records of closed lineages." ;
    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "They are corrected only by appended notes; none is rewritten." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Ex_AP2_Teams a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Exclusion: Teams, week-long sprints and human calendar pacing"@en ;
    backlog:excludesConcern "Teams, week-long sprints and human calendar pacing." ;
    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "The work is done by agents; a box is bounded by its tasks and goals." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Entity_AP2_BoxRecord a backlog:DomainEntity ; rdfs:label "Box record"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
fw:Blueprint_AP2 a backlog:Blueprint ; backlog:blueprintFor fw:Register ; rdfs:label "Blueprint: the records of a box, the archive and the profile, and the checks on how they were made"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_AdaptiveProof2 .
