fw:Find_AP2_OverProcessing a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP2_Decisions ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "Three checks of the gate parsed the same files again inside a loop (the self-application check about 200 times, the lineage-order check about 200 times, the flow-point trace 53 times) and the archived-lineages check ran twice; nobody had timed a check inside its section, only the sections." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Each reads once or keeps what it read by hash; the verdicts were compared and are identical; the gate keys its register-independent sections; the key probe holds the structure." .
fw:Find_AP2_ProbeCost a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP2_Decisions ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "A probe starts the validator once for each planted scenario and each start costs about 7.6 s before any shape runs (parsing 769 shape snippets, serialising, starting shards), so 35 probes cost 1329 s when their inputs change." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Not repaired here. Recorded for a later lineage: a validator that keeps its parsed shapes between scenarios, or a probe that sends all its scenarios in one call (the validator already has --each)." .
fw:Find_AP2_UndeclaredPredicate a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP2_Decisions ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The Definition of Done written by the step tool used a predicate declared nowhere and the link-control probe, which runs only in the gate, refused release 1.468.0 thirty minutes in." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Step tool 1.2.0 writes rdfs:comment; release tool 1.9.0 runs the link-control probe in its preflight." .
fw:Find_AP2_PlannedLate a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP2_Decisions ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "A box is opened and closed inside one release, so the planning events first appear in the commit that also holds the Done stories; the lineage-order check advises PLANNED_LATE for box 1." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Open a box in a records-only stage release before its work begins; to be applied from box 3." .
