    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "The probe judges each closed box of the shipped register as the step tool records a box (Done with start, end and duration; a planning ceremony and events; a checkpoint inside the box; a review after the last checkpoint closing the box and its Done stories; a retrospective with findings that have a cause and a remedy; a Done deployment unit), then plants six faults in copies and requires the judgement to name each, and requires the validator to find no violation in the register under the rule sets it adopted." ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-30T01:48:23Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:verifiedByTool "backlog_boxes_judged_probe_v1_0_0.py + backlog_validate_v1_18_0.py" ;
