    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Achieved ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "Achieved, with one deliverable adapted. The status gap and the review gap are repaired as worded; the note filter is repaired; the unit at the opening is not achieved as worded (the shapes of the register refuse it) and is replaced by a probed arrangement. Five objectives at target; two boxes recorded in order; the post-mortem reviewed by an independent agent. See the closure report for what is not claimed." ; rdfs:label "Mission: the remaining faults of the adaptive profile are repaired"@en ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "A lineage run under the adaptive profile has its status follow its chain, can open a box in order with the deployment unit created at the opening, takes notes that hold links and not text, and has its post-mortem judged by an agent that did not write it." ;
    backlog:missionFor fw:Register ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin backlog:Origin_OwnerStated ;
    backlog:missionSource "Owner, 2026-10-30 07:51: yes, repair the three gaps recorded as not repaired on the closure report of Lineage 22, with the remaining budget limited. Gaps verified on that report." ;
