# Correction appended in box 2 of Lineage 23 (history is kept; the records of box 1 are not edited).
fw:ST_AP3_UnitAtOpen rdfs:comment "Correction made in box 2: this story was closed in box 1 on a probe that checked the tool against a stub register. Opening a box with its deployment unit is refused by the register's own shapes (a unit needs an item, a date and only finished work; the plan must name the unit), so the item as worded is not achieved. What was repaired instead: the plan names the unit at the opening, the unit is written at the close, and the archive integrity check no longer reads the planned unit of a box in progress as dangling. The independent review judged this a narrowing of the deliverable, not a repair of it."@en .
fw:Find_AP3_BoxOpenedByOlderTool rdfs:comment "Correction made in box 2: the promise that the next box would show the unit at the opening was disproved when that box was opened; see the story it concerns and the findings of box 2. The kick-off fix is in step tool 1.4.0; release 1.476.0 carried 1.3.0."@en .
fw:Rel_AP3_1 rdfs:comment "Correction made in box 2: the title says the unit is made at the opening; it is made at the close, as before."@en .
fw:Ckp_AP3_2_1 a backlog:DailyCheckpoint ; rdfs:comment "IndependentReview: An agent that did not write the post-mortem reviewed it against the register and the tools; eight points came back and are recorded as findings of this box."@en ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Monitoring ; backlog:checkpointOfBox fw:It_AP3_2 ; backlog:checkpointAt "2026-10-30T06:48:50Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:openItemCount 0 ; backlog:inProgressItemCount 1 ; backlog:doneItemCount 0 .
