fw:Find_AP3_ReviewUnitAtOpenDescoped a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP3_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the post-mortem): said the item 'unit at opening' is a narrowing of the deliverable, not a repair, and that the story stayed Done with a false result, with title and acceptance criterion unchanged. True: box 1 was closed on a probe against a stub, and the real register refuses a unit at the opening." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Corrections appended to the story, the box 1 finding and the unit; the repair that was possible (plan names the unit, unit at the close, integrity check tolerates a planned unit of a box in progress) is probed. Not repaired as worded: making the shapes admit an empty unit is a decision on the model, handed on." .
fw:Find_AP3_ReviewNoteFilterHeuristic a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP3_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the post-mortem): said the note filter was a fixed prefix list and missed other kinds of identifier. True." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Repaired: the filter now refuses any underscored identifier, any rule identifier, any prefixed name and the story-key form; the probe plants three more. Still a heuristic for free text outside the checkpoint note: not repaired." .
fw:Find_AP3_ReviewStatusProbeNarrow a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP3_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the post-mortem): said the status probe planted only a Goal output against Scoped. True." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Repaired: two cases added (a Backlog output against Goaled and against Objectived)." .
fw:Find_AP3_ReviewKickOffNoProbe a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP3_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the post-mortem): said no probe plants another lineage's kick-off and that the finding named tool 1.3.0 while the fix is in 1.4.0. True." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Finding comment appended for the tool version. No probe case for the kick-off of another lineage: not repaired, handed on." .
fw:Find_AP3_ReviewWorkOutsideBox a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP3_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the post-mortem): said eight governed files were changed before box 2 opened, so work happened outside any box, and the post-mortem did not say so. True: the tool needed to open the box had to change first." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Disclosed in the opening of the box; the cause is that the tool that opens a box is also a tool a box changes. Not repaired: it is a known property of the rule, recorded." .
fw:Find_AP3_ReviewCostUnsourced a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP3_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the post-mortem): said the release times had no cited source. They come from the release log of the run (1875 s for release 1.476.0, in which shapes and tools changed so the validator cache was invalid; 426 s for the earlier records-only full gate)." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Cited here; the release log is not part of the package, so the figures stay unverifiable from it." .
fw:Find_AP3_ReviewNoteOnlyInStepTool a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP3_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the post-mortem): said only the step tool checks notes. True: free text written by hand outside the tool is not covered." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Not repaired; the link-control probe in the preflight covers the register as a whole." .
fw:Find_AP3_ReviewRepairedIsHalf a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AP3_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the post-mortem): said gap (b) is half repaired and gap (c) is repaired only once this review is recorded. Both are accepted." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Gap (a) repaired; gap (b): the note filter repaired, the unit at opening not as worded; gap (c) repaired by this review." .
