    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Count of the scope's deliverables with no satisfying item Done: 0, counting the unit at the opening in its adapted form (the plan names the unit, the unit is written at the close, and the integrity check reads the planned unit of an open box as planned), because the shapes of the register refuse the form as worded. The adaptation follows the Owner's standing leave to adapt scope when a requirement is found to be wrong; it is disclosed to the Owner at the closure, and the original wording is recorded as unmet in the story's correction." .
