# ---------------------------------------------------------------
#  v1.477.0 -- LINEAGE 23 closure: the mission is achieved, in one deliverable adapted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
fw:CR_AdaptiveProof3 a backlog:ClosureReport ;
    backlog:closesForMission fw:Mission_AdaptiveProof3 ;
    backlog:reportGeneratedAt "2026-10-30T06:55:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasClosureSummary "The mission asked that a lineage under the adaptive profile have its status follow its chain, open a box in order with the deployment unit, take notes that hold links, and have its post-mortem judged by an agent other than its writer. Measured by five objectives, all at target: scope deliverables unsatisfied 3 to 0 (the unit at the opening in an adapted form: the shapes of the register refuse a unit that carries unfinished work, so the plan names the unit at the opening, the unit is written at the close and the integrity check reads a planned unit of an open box as planned); lineages whose status is behind their chain and are not refused 1 to 0 (shape clause, fixture case, probe); step-tool faults 2 to 0 (the note filter refuses identifiers of any kind and the kick-off is that of the lineage itself; the unit at the opening as worded is not achieved); post-mortems judged only by their writer 1 to 0 (eight review points by an independent agent, recorded); profile inclusions changed 0. The independent review overturned the builder's claim that the unit item was repaired, and two probes were widened." ;
    backlog:reportsOnObjective fw:Obj_AP3_MissionMet , fw:Obj_AP3_Status , fw:Obj_AP3_Step , fw:Obj_AP3_Review , fw:Obj_AP3_Contained ;
    backlog:citesFinding fw:Find_AP3_BoxOpenedByOlderTool , fw:Find_AP3_KickOffOfAnotherLineage , fw:Find_AP3_ReviewCostUnsourced , fw:Find_AP3_ReviewKickOffNoProbe , fw:Find_AP3_ReviewNoteFilterHeuristic , fw:Find_AP3_ReviewNoteOnlyInStepTool , fw:Find_AP3_ReviewRepairedIsHalf , fw:Find_AP3_ReviewStatusProbeNarrow , fw:Find_AP3_ReviewUnitAtOpenDescoped , fw:Find_AP3_ReviewWorkOutsideBox ;
    backlog:statesBestPractice "Test a tool against the real register before closing the story that changes it: the unit at the opening passed a probe on a stub and was refused by the register at the next box." ,
        "Have the post-mortem judged by an agent that did not write it before the closure: the review found a claim of repair that the evidence did not support." ,
        "Say what was not achieved as worded: the unit at the opening is recorded as unmet in its original form, and what replaced it is probed." .

