fw:Mission_AgenticAdaptive a backlog:Mission ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Achieved ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "Achieved as worded. The profiles, the step-tool records, the default mark and the independent review exist and are probed; the accountability is recorded and not proved, and the lineage ran under the non-agentic profile because the agentic one did not yet exist. See the closure report for what is not claimed." ; rdfs:label "Mission: the agentic adaptive lineage exists beside the non-agentic one"@en ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "A lineage can be run as an agentic adaptive lineage (AAL) beside the non-agentic adaptive lineage (NAAL): the step tool records who made each move and who made, oversaw, verified and approved each Done story, the profile that opens such a lineage exists and is named, and a profile can be marked the default." ;
    backlog:missionFor fw:Register ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin backlog:Origin_OwnerStated ;
    backlog:missionSource "Owner, 2026-11-01 11:45: agentic and non-agentic versions should be two different lineages; develop AAL next to NAAL first, and after that make AAL the default. Gaps verified on the register: adopting the agent-accountability rule set adds 38 violations and independent verification 6; no profile is marked as the default." ;
    backlog:producedByStage fw:Out_Mission_AgenticAdaptive ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
