fw:Find_AA_TasksNeedRoles a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AA_MakerRecorded ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The first run of the probe against the real validator drew four violations: the task of a story is a work item too and needs the same maker, overseer, verifier and approver. A stub validator would have shown none, which is how the unit-at-opening fault of Lineage 23 went unseen." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Repaired: the tool records the roles for the task as well as the story; the probe judges with the real validator." .
fw:Find_AA_StageScriptKeptOldStatus a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AA_AALProfile ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The script that releases a chain stage moved the status only from Opened, so the Goal stage left the status at Scoped and the new rule of Lineage 23 refused the release at the preflight, as designed; the next stage was then rolled on top, and both attempts had to be discarded and redone as separate releases." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Repaired in the script. The refusal was the first live use of the rule that a status behind its chain is refused." .
fw:Find_AA_EntityStagesAgain a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AA_AALProfile ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The generator of the Backlog stage covered one life-cycle stage of the lineage entity only, as in Lineage 23, and the preflight refused it; the stage was fixed by hand and the generator was not." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Not repaired in the package (the generator is working material); the next chain is generated with stages set per story." .
fw:Find_AA_ReviewIsRecordedNotProved a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AA_FourRoles ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The step tool checks that a review file exists, is not empty, is newer than the box and was not written under the maker's name, but it cannot prove that an agent other than the maker wrote it." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Not repaired and not repairable by the tool: stated in the ruling narrative; the live run under the profile will show how the review is kept." .
