fw:Find_AA_ReviewRecordsNominal a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_AA_IndependentReview ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "the independent reviewer agent (an Explore agent that did not write the work): said the overseer and approver records are weaker than the review-file limit admits: the tool writes all four runs itself, the monitor's list is only a comment, and the verifier is a name. Partly true: the approving run exists only if the validator accepted the close (a refused close is put back), the monitor always lists the box in progress and so cannot gate a close, and the verifier identity is a name." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Narrative of the ruling corrected to say the records are recorded and not proved. Not repaired: proving independence needs a second party that the tool does not control." .
