# ---------------------------------------------------------------
#  v1.484.0 -- LINEAGE 24 closure: the mission is achieved as worded; the records are recorded, not proved.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
fw:CR_AgenticAdaptive a backlog:ClosureReport ;
    backlog:closesForMission fw:Mission_AgenticAdaptive ;
    backlog:reportGeneratedAt "2026-11-01T10:25:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasClosureSummary "The mission asked that a lineage can be run as an agentic adaptive lineage (AAL) beside the non-agentic one (NAAL): the step tool records who made each move and who did, oversaw, verified and approved each Done item, the profile exists and is named, and a profile can be marked the default. Measured by six objectives, all at target: scope deliverables unsatisfied 4 to 0; profiles absent 2 to 0 (NAAL named and unchanged, AAL as revision 10 with eighteen rule sets); violations of the two agentic rule sets in a box recorded by the tool 44 to 0 (the real validator judges a register the tool writes; a control shows it names the fault); default-mechanism cases mishandled 3 to 0; post-mortems judged only by their writer 1 to 0 (seven review points by an independent agent); profile inclusions lost 0. Not claimed: the accountability is recorded and not proved (the tool cannot show that the verifier is another agent), the probe judges a one-story register, this lineage ran under NAAL, and no person approves work at the integrity level this family uses. No profile is marked the default." ;
    backlog:reportsOnObjective fw:Obj_AA_MissionMet , fw:Obj_AA_Profiles , fw:Obj_AA_Accountability , fw:Obj_AA_Default , fw:Obj_AA_Review , fw:Obj_AA_Contained ;
    backlog:citesFinding fw:Find_AA_EntityStagesAgain , fw:Find_AA_ReviewBaselineFile , fw:Find_AA_ReviewBaselineSource , fw:Find_AA_ReviewHumanLevelVacuous , fw:Find_AA_ReviewIsRecordedNotProved , fw:Find_AA_ReviewNotOwnProfile , fw:Find_AA_ReviewProbeToy , fw:Find_AA_ReviewRecordsNominal , fw:Find_AA_ReviewRuleSetsLeftOut , fw:Find_AA_StageScriptKeptOldStatus , fw:Find_AA_TasksNeedRoles ;
    backlog:statesBestPractice "Judge a tool that writes records with the real validator on the register it wrote: the stub that hid the fault of the previous lineage would have hidden the task roles here." ,
        "Say recorded and not proved where a tool can record a fact but cannot establish it: the verifier is a name and a kept file." ,
        "Let a release script move the status with the stage: the rule that refuses a status behind its chain refused the script, as designed." .

