fw:Mission_AgenticProof a backlog:Mission ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Achieved ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "Achieved as worded, on two boxes. The lineage ran under AAL on the live register, each box was closed by the step tool with a kept review by a fresh verifying agent, the register stayed free of violations, and AAL then became the default (ruling G183). Not claimed: that the accountability is proved (it is recorded), that the verifier is independent in command (it is in context), that two boxes show a long lineage, or that a person approved the work (integrity level 2 sits below the stated approval level 3). See the closure report." ; rdfs:label "Mission: the agentic adaptive lineage is proved live and becomes the default"@en ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "A lineage is run live under the agentic adaptive profile (AAL), every box closed by the step tool with a verifying agent that did not do the work, and, if the run is clean, AAL becomes the profile that opens a lineage when none is named." ;
    backlog:missionFor fw:Register ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin backlog:Origin_OwnerStated ;
    backlog:missionSource "Owner, 2026-11-01 11:45: develop AAL next to NAAL first and after that make AAL the default. The default follows a live run (standing direction: the default changes only after a live proof). Gap verified on the closure of Lineage 24: AAL has been probed on toy registers only and no profile is marked." ;
    backlog:producedByStage fw:Out_Mission_AgenticProof ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
