    backlog:hasScopeStatementText "Run this lineage live under AAL and nothing else: (1) hold the kick-off lookup of the step tool by a probe; (2) close every box with the step tool and a verifying agent that did not do the work, so that the register holds no violation under the eighteen rule sets of AAL; (3) mark AAL as the default profile after the first box is clean; (4) have the post-mortem reviewed by an agent that did not write it." ;
