    backlog:closesForMission fw:Mission_AgenticProof ;
    backlog:reportGeneratedAt "2026-11-01T12:20:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasClosureSummary "The mission asked that the agentic adaptive lineage (AAL) be proved on a live lineage and then become the default profile. Lineage 25 opened under AAL on the live register and ran two boxes through the step tool, which named the builder run on every move and the roles on every Done item. Box 1 fixed the kick-off lookup (probe of 23 expectations) and was reviewed by a fresh verifying agent (holds with reservations: the probe tests the function, not the opening, and two of three new expectations catch a revert; both left unrepaired). Box 2 marked AAL the default (ruling G183), shown by a probe on the live register (one marked profile; 9, 10, 16 and 18 rule sets kept; the opening tool with no profile opens AAL), and was reviewed by a second fresh agent (holds with reservations: narrative ahead of the record, box 1 reservations omitted from the draft, one deliverable without a story; all met). Six objectives, all at target; the register validated with no violation at each open and close. Limits: accountability is recorded, not proved; the verifier is a fresh agent briefed by the builder, independent in context and not in command; two boxes are not a long lineage; integrity level 2 sits below the stated human approval level 3, so no person approved this work; NAAL stays available by naming it." ;
    backlog:reportsOnObjective fw:Obj_AL_MissionMet , fw:Obj_AL_Proof , fw:Obj_AL_Default , fw:Obj_AL_Kickoff , fw:Obj_AL_Review , fw:Obj_AL_Contained ;
    backlog:citesFinding fw:Find_AL_ProbeTestsFunctionNotOpen , fw:Find_AL_PlanningRunNeeded , fw:Find_AL_FirstLiveBoxUnderAAL , fw:Find_AL_NarrativeAheadOfRecord , fw:Find_AL_ReviewOmitsBox1Reservations , fw:Find_AL_DeliverableWithoutStory ;
    backlog:statesBestPractice "Make a default only after a live run, and mark it on the profile alone: the other profiles keep their rule sets." ,
        "Give every deliverable a satisfying item before the close, or the mission cannot show as met." ,
        "Write a ruling narrative after the box closes, not before: a reviewer found it a tense ahead of the record." .

# ---- Lineage 26: opening and Mission stage ----
fw:L_VerifierSession a backlog:Lineage ; rdfs:label "Lineage 26: the AAL verifier recorded to the Agentic-Systems standard"@en ;
