        backlog:RS_StatusHistoryRecorded .
fw:Mission_VerifierSession a backlog:Mission ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Achieved ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "Achieved as worded, on three boxes. A rule set and four shapes refuse a verifier run without its session record, AAL includes the rule set from revision 11, the step tool writes the record, and both packages that hold the standard were told by a note delivered to their inboxes. Not claimed: that the verifier starts when the builder says, that the grant is given by a person (it is given by the builder below the stated approval level), that the place was unchanged for the files the digest leaves out, or that this lineage itself is bound by the rule set it made (it opened before it existed; its second box is clean under it in a trial copy and its first is not). See the closure report." ; rdfs:label "Mission: the AAL verifier is recorded to the Agentic-Systems standard"@en ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "The verifier of a box in an agentic adaptive lineage (AAL) is recorded to the standard of the Agentic-Systems package: a plan fixed before the start, a grant of access, the way it started, the session that carried it out, whether the place was unchanged, and the configuration it ran in; a shape refuses a box without them, and the packages that hold the standard are told." ;
    backlog:missionFor fw:Register ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin backlog:Origin_OwnerStated ;
    backlog:missionSource "Owner, 2026-11-01 20:38 and 21:02: run a test drive and a fit-gap analysis of AAL against the standards of Agentic-Systems and the agent-based BRSF methodology, then proceed on the plan. Gaps verified: the test drive of 2026-11-01 found eight in the verifier record, and a verifier run passes the Agentic-Systems shapes vacuously." ;
    backlog:producedByStage fw:Out_Mission_VerifierSession ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
fw:Out_Mission_VerifierSession a backlog:StageOutput ;
    backlog:outputOfStage backlog:Stage_Mission ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_VerifierSession ;
    backlog:hasStateDigest "2095e12eb815c3d91e589e66bbd1dba15da3f6ee7bdf33d1767bc3a501836533" ;
    backlog:closedAtCommit "backlog-roadmap-framework-v1.492.0 (tag; witnessed by git, not asserted)" ;
    backlog:hasRationale "Mission stage of Lineage 26, opened under the agentic adaptive profile (AAL), profile revision 10, as the default profile. Stage 1 of 5, one release each." .

# ---- Lineage 26: Scope stage ----
fw:Scope_VerifierSession a backlog:ScopeStatement ; rdfs:label "Scope: the verifier session record"@en ;
    backlog:hasScopeStatementText "Close the eight gaps found in the test drive and nothing else: (1) a rule set and a shape that refuse a verifier run without the record, included by AAL in a new revision; (2) the step tool records the verifier session and the overseer findings; (3) a handover to each package that holds the standard; (4) the other profiles and closed lineages are not changed." ;
