fw:Ruling_G185 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G185" ;
    rdfs:label "The step tool records the verifier session; the order of its start is witnessed, not proved"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "In an agentic lineage the step tool records, at the close of a box, the verifier's plan with its digest, the grant of access, the way it started, the session, whether the governed files were unchanged since the brief was fixed, and a configuration made when the brief was fixed; it stamps the verifier run with the start the builder stated, which must lie between the fixing of the brief and the writing of the review; the iteration and the unit of the box name their overseer, verifier and approver; each item of the overseer's escalation list is a finding. No shape can reach that the verifier started when the builder says or that the builder fixed the brief before the verifier read it: the order is witnessed by file times and the builder's statement, and this ruling says so." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:VerifierSessionRecordShape , backlog:VerifierGrantOrderShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v149.0.0, section G185." .
fw:Ruling_G185 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_VerifierSession .
