    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "The tool is run as it is run for real in a throwaway package and the real validator judges the register it wrote: refusals for a missing plan, a brief never fixed, a brief changed after it was fixed, a start before the fixing or after the review; a box that records the session, the stamp, the configuration, the roles of the iteration and unit and the escalation findings; a second box in which a governed file changed after the fixing and the place is recorded as not unchanged; no violation of the agentic rule sets or the verifier session rule set." ;
