fw:CR_VerifierSession a backlog:ClosureReport ;
    backlog:closesForMission fw:Mission_VerifierSession ;
    backlog:reportGeneratedAt "2026-11-01T21:05:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasClosureSummary "The mission asked that the verifier of an agentic adaptive lineage be recorded to the standard of the Agentic-Systems package. A test drive found eight gaps: a verifier run as AAL recorded it passed that package's shapes with no finding. Box 1 added the rule set RS_VerifierSession (profile revision 11, AAL now holds 19 rule sets; the other profiles keep 9, 10 and 16) and four shapes, after a reviewer found runs that passed and the shapes were tightened (nineteen-run probe on the real validator). Box 2 made the step tool write the record: the brief fixed by digest before the verifier starts, the grant, the plan, the start way, the session, whether the place was unchanged, a configuration, the verifier stamped at its start, roles on the iteration and unit, and one finding per overseer item; the reviewer showed what the place-unchanged statement leaves out and that the frozen record is forgeable. Box 3 delivered a note to each package that holds the standard; the reviewer found an overstatement in one, corrected by a replacement note. Four objectives at target: gaps 8 to 0, handovers 2 to 0, containment held, deliverables 4 to 0. Limits: the order of the verifier's start is witnessed by file times and the builder's statement, not proved; the grant is by the builder below the approval level; this lineage opened before the rule set existed, so it is not bound by it (its second box is clean under it in a trial copy, its first is not); notes reached the inboxes by a commit to each recipient repository; two escalation items about the first box of this lineage stay open." ;
    backlog:reportsOnObjective fw:Obj_VS_MissionMet , fw:Obj_VS_Gaps , fw:Obj_VS_Handover , fw:Obj_VS_Kept ;
    backlog:citesFinding fw:Find_VS_ShapesLetRunsThrough , fw:Find_VS_TestDriveNotKept , fw:Find_VS_TermsDomainDiffers , fw:Find_VS_VerifiedByOnly , fw:Find_VS_DigestLeavesOut , fw:Find_VS_FrozenRecordForgeable , fw:Find_VS_NarrativeOverstatedWitnesses , fw:Find_VS_Esc2_1 , fw:Find_VS_Esc2_2 , fw:Find_VS_Esc2_3 , fw:Find_VS_Esc2_4 , fw:Find_VS_Esc2_5 , fw:Find_VS_SdlcNoteOverstated , fw:Find_VS_DeliveredByCommit , fw:Find_VS_AssertedNotShownInNotes ;
    backlog:statesBestPractice "Tell a verifier apart from a name: its plan fixed before it starts, its grant, its session and its configuration are records, and a shape that never fires on a run lacking them proves nothing." ,
        "Open a box before the work, not after: the work of this lineage's second and third boxes began before they were opened and was disclosed, which the tool allows and the record then shows." ,
        "Read what the overseer lists: its list had named the iterations and units of every earlier box for several boxes before it was read." .

