# ---- Lineage 28, box 1: dates planned before they are stated (G186) ----
backlog:RS_PlannedDates a owl:NamedIndividual , backlog:RuleSet ;
    rdfs:label "A measure date comes from a forecast made at planning"@en ;
    skos:definition "Within an adopting lineage, every checkpoint date of an objective rests on a forecast: a dated statement of when the work that moves the objective is expected to be done, with its assumptions and the velocity observed in earlier boxes, and the checkpoint is not dated earlier than the forecast expects. A RuleSet because it binds only lineages that adopt it; a lineage opened under an earlier revision is not bound."@en .
backlog:Pr_12 a owl:NamedIndividual , backlog:ProfileRevision ; rdfs:label "Profile revision 12"@en ; backlog:revisionNumber 12 ; skos:definition "Adds to the agentic adaptive profile (AAL) the rule set of planned dates, so that a lineage opened under it dates its checkpoints from a forecast made at planning. The other profiles are not changed."@en .
backlog:Profile_AgenticAdaptive backlog:profileIncludes backlog:RS_PlannedDates .
backlog:RS_PlannedDates backlog:introducedInRevision backlog:Pr_12 .
fw:Ruling_G186 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G186" ;
    rdfs:label "A measure date is set at planning from a forecast, not stated to meet a goal on time"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "A lineage that adopts RS_PlannedDates dates each checkpoint from a forecast made at planning: the forecast gives the date the work that moves the objective is expected to be done, the assumptions it rests on and the velocity observed in earlier boxes, and the checkpoint is not earlier than that date. The forecast is shown for discussion before the dates are final. AAL includes the rule set from profile revision 12; the other profiles are unchanged." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:PlannedDatesShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v150.0.0, section G186; Owner direction of 2026-11-02 10:22." .
fw:Ruling_G186 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_PlannedDates , backlog:Pr_12 , backlog:Profile_AgenticAdaptive .

