# ---- Lineage 28, box 3: the dates are reported (G188) ----
fw:Ruling_G188 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G188" ;
    rdfs:label "The base, updated and finished dates are reported, the updated date derived and never stored"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "The updated date of an objective is derived from the boxes that hold the stories that move it: the end of a finished box, the planned end of an open one. The finished date is the first reading of the unbroken run, ending at the latest reading, in which the objective stood at its target; an objective whose latest reading does not stand at the target is open. The base, updated and finished dates of every objective and the base plan, actual end and variance of every box are reported by backlog_date_report. A report refuses nothing, so no shape can enforce the reporting itself; the shapes name what it reads: a base date backed by a forecast and a base plan for every box. The reporting is carried by the tool and its probe." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:PlannedDatesShape , backlog:BoxBasePlanShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v152.0.0, section G188; Owner direction of 2026-11-02 10:22." .
fw:Ruling_G188 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_PlannedDates .
fw:Ckp_PD_3_1 a backlog:DailyCheckpoint ; rdfs:comment "BaseUpdatedFinished: Built the dates report: for each objective it shows the base date with its forecast, the updated date derived from the boxes that hold the stories moving it, the finished date from the observations, and the variances in hours; for each box its base plan, actual end and variance, with late dates marked. Probe on a planted register computed by hand, including holds; ruling written down."@en ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Monitoring ; backlog:checkpointOfBox fw:It_PD_3 ; backlog:checkpointAt "2026-11-02T12:21:15Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:openItemCount 0 ; backlog:inProgressItemCount 1 ; backlog:doneItemCount 0 .
fw:Ckp_PD_3_2 a backlog:DailyCheckpoint ; rdfs:comment "BaseUpdatedFinished: Repaired what the first review found in the dates report: a decrease or increase that reached its target and was later broken is open, times with an offset are printed in UTC, a date alone is midnight UTC, a mover in a box with no end is counted, an open box past its planned end is marked, and the wording of the ruling and the narrative was corrected. Eight more cases in the probe."@en ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Monitoring ; backlog:checkpointOfBox fw:It_PD_3 ; backlog:checkpointAt "2026-11-02T12:23:29Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:openItemCount 0 ; backlog:inProgressItemCount 1 ; backlog:doneItemCount 0 .
