# ---- Lineage 28: closure ----
fw:CR_PlannedDates a backlog:ClosureReport ;
    backlog:closesForMission fw:Mission_PlannedDates ;
    backlog:reportGeneratedAt "2026-11-02T12:31:55Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasClosureSummary "The mission asked that every measure date of a lineage come from its plan. The Owner's direction of 2026-11-02 10:22 made three pieces of work, one box each, every box checked by a fresh agent. Box 1: a checkpoint date of a lineage that adopts the rule set of planned dates is backed by its own forecast (a new link, a shape, the tool backlog_date_plan that predicts the date from the points still to do and the pace delivered in earlier boxes, with a buffer of 1.5), and five forecasts were recorded for this lineage; the first review found a shape that let through an empty assumption, a shared forecast and a string date, and a pace measured on planned load, all repaired. Box 2: the box step tool (1.10.0) records a base plan for every box it opens and checks the objectives the box moves against its planned end; a box without one is refused in a bound lineage; a finished box is no longer refused for ending when it did. Box 3: backlog_date_report prints the base, updated and finished dates of each objective and the plan against the actual end of each box; the first review found four defects (a broken objective still printed as finished, local times printed as UTC, a dropped mover, a crash on a date-typed checkpoint), all repaired and confirmed by a second review. Objectives at target: objective dates with no base plan behind them 5 to 0, boxes whose dates were not recomputed 3 to 0, kinds of date not shown side by side 2 to 0, deliverables not satisfied 4 to 0, containment held. For this lineage the report shows every updated date ahead of the base date of 2026-11-04, and box 2 finished 1.2 hours before its planned end. Limits: the base dates of this lineage were stated before the rule existed and its forecasts follow them (said in each forecast); the shapes have not fired on real data because this lineage is not bound by them; nothing records that a forecast was discussed before the dates were final; the opening of a box calling the base plan is tested only through the routine; the report crashes on malformed records and prints a box that is Done with no end as open; the agent stays the grantor of the reviewers' access, an open gap against the Agentic-Systems rule that a person grants access. Unplanned: one link was added at the close of box 2 because rule L3 refused the close, and the outcome of the five objectives of this lineage is recorded now (Retrospective) because their checkpoints of 2026-11-04 would otherwise fall due with no observation dated after them and refuse every release; a later lineage should have the step tool record this at the close." ;
    backlog:reportsOnObjective fw:Obj_PD_MissionMet , fw:Obj_PD_Plan , fw:Obj_PD_Update , fw:Obj_PD_Report , fw:Obj_PD_Kept ;
    backlog:citesFinding fw:Find_PD_BaselineDatesUntyped , fw:Find_PD_DoneBoxPlan , fw:Find_PD_DoneBoxWithoutEnd , fw:Find_PD_FirstReviewDefects , fw:Find_PD_HypotheticalSentence , fw:Find_PD_IdleBoxesDropped , fw:Find_PD_MalformedInputCrashes , fw:Find_PD_MoverAddedAfterReview , fw:Find_PD_NotDiscussedNotFired , fw:Find_PD_OpenCallUntested , fw:Find_PD_ReportFirstReviewDefects , fw:Find_PD_ShapeGaps , fw:Find_PD_SilentDefaults , fw:Find_PD_WarningOnlyAndAllLineages , fw:Find_PD_WhitespaceAssumption ;
    backlog:statesBestPractice "Date a measure from a forecast made at planning, write its assumptions beside it, and report the base, the updated and the finished date together." ,
        "Run a review again after repairing what the first one found; the second review found what the repair left." .

# Outcome of the objectives of Lineage 28 recorded at its close (see the closure report): Retrospective, the counts read what they read.
fw:Obj_PD_MissionMet backlog:hasAchievementStatus backlog:Ach_Retrospective ; backlog:hasRationale "Counted at the close of Lineage 28 on 2026-11-02: the last observation stands at the target; the checkpoint of 2026-11-04 is not waited for, because the work finished ahead of its base date." .
fw:Obj_PD_Plan backlog:hasAchievementStatus backlog:Ach_Retrospective ; backlog:hasRationale "Counted at the close of Lineage 28 on 2026-11-02: the last observation stands at the target; the checkpoint of 2026-11-04 is not waited for, because the work finished ahead of its base date." .
fw:Obj_PD_Update backlog:hasAchievementStatus backlog:Ach_Retrospective ; backlog:hasRationale "Counted at the close of Lineage 28 on 2026-11-02: the last observation stands at the target; the checkpoint of 2026-11-04 is not waited for, because the work finished ahead of its base date." .
fw:Obj_PD_Report backlog:hasAchievementStatus backlog:Ach_Retrospective ; backlog:hasRationale "Counted at the close of Lineage 28 on 2026-11-02: the last observation stands at the target; the checkpoint of 2026-11-04 is not waited for, because the work finished ahead of its base date." .
