    backlog:attestsCriterion fw:AC_IK_WaysToClear ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "The shapes were run on a scratch register (no way, a way the kind does not list, two ways, a non-way, a way with no resolved time, an open impediment, a lineage not bound, a kind with no way) and the real register was read: seven kinds each listing at least one way, fourteen ways each labelled, defined, saying when the obstacle is gone and listed by a kind. The first review found two ways that clear nothing, shape holes and vague steps; they were repaired and reviewed again." ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-11-02T15:53:40Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:verifiedByTool "backlog_impediment_method_probe, ClearedImpedimentNamesMethodShape, KindHasMethodShape, and two independent verifying agents (two reviews)" ;
