fw:Find_IK_WaysFirstReviewDefects a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_WaysToClear ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The first review found two listed ways that clear nothing (continuing unrelated work, reporting partial progress), a way that only narrows a claim offered for a tool at fault, a check of wording that tested nothing, a cleared impediment with no resolved time accepted, vague steps and a contradiction between two ways." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Repaired and reviewed again: the two ways were removed, the limit is offered only for evidence missing and access limited, a shape refuses a way with no resolved time, steps were made concrete; the second reviewer confirmed the shapes, the fixtures and the documents." .
fw:Find_IK_WaysEvidenceAndServiceGaps a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_WaysToClear ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "Evidence missing still has no way that produces the missing evidence, and stating the limit does not satisfy a stage obligation that needs it; an outside service failing lists only a bounded retry, whose text says another way applies, and none is listed; the three ways for work in the wrong order disagree on whether recorded files may be edited." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Not repaired in this box: the next box adds the advise command and repairs the lists with it." .
fw:Find_IK_WaysUncheckedPoints a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_WaysToClear ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The resolved time is not checked for being a date or for following the raise time; asking the Owner is listed before deciding by the rule with no gate saying the rules must leave the choice open; the probe cannot detect a removed way coming back or test the per-kind lists; a cleared impediment with no kind is passed outside a lineage that adopts the rule set; the checkpoint text of the first act still says sixteen ways." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Not repaired in this box; stated here and in the narrative where it applies." .
