# Lineage 29, box 3: raise, advise and clear an obstacle (G191)
fw:Ruling_G191 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G191" ;
    rdfs:label "An obstacle is raised, advised on and cleared through one tool, and watched in hours"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "An obstacle is raised, advised on and cleared with backlog_impediment: raising names what it blocks, its kind, its statement and its owner and shows the ways that fit the kind; clearing names the way used, one the kind lists, at a time not before it was raised. The agent monitor lists every impediment not yet resolved with the hours it has stood, its kind and the ways that clear it, each one on the escalation list; the dates report names, for each box that is late or past its plan, the impediments that stood open while it ran. The kind and method shapes hold that an impediment of an adopting lineage has a kind and a way, that a way is one its kind lists and that a way comes with a time resolved; the tool itself holds that the owner is a role, that the time is not before the raise or in the future, and that what is blocked is not a role, kind, way, impediment, lineage, rule set or ruling. The monitor and the report only read." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:ImpedimentKindShape , backlog:ClearedImpedimentNamesMethodShape , backlog:KindHasMethodShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v155.0.0, section G191; Owner direction of 2026-11-02 10:35." .
fw:Ruling_G191 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_ImpedimentsKnown .
