    backlog:hasDemoShown "An obstacle is raised with its kind and what it blocks, the ways that fit are shown, and it is cleared naming a way its kind lists; the monitor lists every open obstacle with its hours, and the dates report names the obstacles that stood in a late box." ;
    backlog:hasDemoResult "An obstacle can be raised, advised on and cleared with one tool, open ones are watched in hours, and a late box shows what stood in its way." .
