fw:Obj_IK_Record backlog:hasAchievementStatus backlog:Ach_Retrospective ; backlog:hasRationale "Counted at the close of Lineage 29 on 2026-11-02: the last observation stands at the target; the checkpoint of 2026-11-03 is not waited for, because the work finished ahead of its base date." .
