# ---- Lineage 30: Backlog stage ----
fw:Run_CS_0_Builder a backlog:ExecutorInstance , backlog:Executor_SingleAgent ; backlog:instanceOf fw:Exec_Builder ; backlog:instantiatedFromVersion "1.9.0" ; backlog:instantiatedAt "2026-11-03T12:40:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "The run that wrote the backlog; the run of each box is added by the step tool when the box opens." .
fw:AC_CS_Tools a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Given a session start with unchanged disciplines, When the start command runs, Then it says unchanged in a few lines; Given edited probes, When the first look runs, Then it runs only those within a minute; Given a gate log, When the digest runs, Then it prints the failing sections and the verdict in about ten lines." .
