    backlog:harnessFor fw:ST_GS_Probes ; backlog:hasHarnessEvidence fw:Ev_GS_Probes ; backlog:harnessComplete true ;
    backlog:hasRationale "Temporary registers and temporary memo directories; eight cases; the loop replica runs every probe of the gate's probe list two at a time with the tracer." .
fw:Demo_GS_Probes a backlog:DemoRun ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Control ; backlog:demonstratesItem fw:ST_GS_Probes ; backlog:demonstratedAgainst fw:AC_GS_Probes ; backlog:demoAt "2026-11-03T15:57:49Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDemoShown "The equivalence probe with python3 -I, with and without an empty memo directory: eight of eight hold; the cold loop: every probe of the list passes." ;
    backlog:hasDemoResult "Eight of eight hold. The probe loop took 508 seconds against 1,196 in 4.2.0; the serial key phase before the loop (about 47 seconds) is outside that figure, so the gate's own section is read from the gate-times file of the release." .
