fw:Find_GS_WorkBeforeOpen a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_GS_Probes ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The work of this story was begun before the box was opened, so the opening had to disclose the changed files instead of finding none." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "The box tool refused nothing it should have; the disclosure is recorded at the opening. Open the box of the next story before the first edit." .
fw:Find_GS_TrustByName a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_GS_Probes ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The validator's kept inputs (aux files in the memo directory) are trusted by their name, as the shape bundle already is: a file planted there by someone who can write the directory would be believed. Without a memo directory they go to the temporary directory." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Stated plainly in the change-log entry of the release. A check of the content on reading, and no fallback to the temporary directory, are open items for a later box." .
fw:Find_GS_NoEquivalenceProbe a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_GS_Probes ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "Nothing tests N-Triples against Turtle verdicts or that the kept files are read back, apart from the whole and restricted comparison, the gate's own fixture sections that now run through the same path, and a second run of the equivalence probe in one memo directory." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Open item: add a case comparing the verdicts of the same data through both formats and through a replayed kept file." .
fw:Find_GS_ExitCodeIgnored a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_GS_Probes ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The sixteen probes count result lines and do not read the validator's exit code, so a refusal of a restricted run would read as zero results; the equivalence probe proves the refusal, and the expectations of 1 would fail." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Accepted: the expectations of one fail on a refusal; the expectations of zero are protected only by the refusal of unmatched texts. Revisit in the next box." .
fw:Find_GS_LoopBoundary a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_GS_Probes ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The measured 508 seconds leave out the serial key phase before the loop (about 47 seconds), the cold fixture sections after a validator change and machine load." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "The gate-times file of the release gives the section's own seconds; the objective is judged on that figure in the next box." .
